// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/ext_power.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Sym         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
            &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E          &kp R         &kp T          &kp Y         &kp U        &kp I            &kp O       &kp P
            &hm LGUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D    &hm LSHIFT F  &kp G          &kp H         &hm RSHFT J  &hm RCTRL K      &hm RALT L  &hm RGUI SEMICOLON
&kp ESCAPE  &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C          &kp V         &kp B          &kp N         &kp M        &kp COMMA        &kp DOT     &kp SLASH           &kp APOSTROPHE
                                    &mt LCTRL TAB  &to 2         &lt 4 SPACE    &lt 3 RETURN  &to 1        &lt 5 BACKSPACE
            >;
        };

        Numpad {
            display-name = "Numpad";
            bindings = <
                &kp SLASH     &kp N7        &kp N8        &kp N9        &kp MINUS    &trans  &trans      &trans     &trans    &trans
                &kp ASTERISK  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp N5        &kp NUMBER_6  &kp PLUS     &trans  &kp LSHIFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT  &kp LEFT_GUI
&studio_unlock  &kp TILDE     &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp EQUAL    &trans  &trans      &trans     &trans    &trans        &trans
                                            &kp PERIOD    &kp NUMBER_0  &trans       &trans  &trans      &trans
            >;
        };

        Symbols {
            display-name = "Symbols";
            bindings = <
           &kp F1          &kp F2       &kp F3            &kp F4                &kp F5            &kp F8           &kp F9                 &kp F10            &kp F11    &kp F12
           &kp EXCL        &kp AT_SIGN  &kp HASH          &kp DOLLAR            &kp PERCENT       &kp CARET        &kp AMPERSAND          &kp ASTERISK       &kp MINUS  &kp EQUAL
&kp TILDE  &kp UNDERSCORE  &kp PIPE     &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp LEFT_BRACE    &kp RIGHT_BRACE  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp PLUS   &kp BACKSLASH  &kp GRAVE
                                        &trans            &trans                &trans            &trans           &trans                 &kp DELETE
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
        &trans        &trans        &trans     &trans      &trans    &kp K_PASTE  &kp K_COPY      &kp K_CUT     &kp K_UNDO  &kp K_REDO
        &kp LEFT_GUI  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHIFT  &trans    &kp LEFT     &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp UP_ARROW  &kp RIGHT   &kp CAPS
&trans  &trans        &trans        &trans     &trans      &trans    &kp HOME     &kp PG_DN       &kp PG_UP     &kp END     &kp INS     &trans
                                    &trans     &trans      &trans    &trans       &trans          &trans
            >;
        };

        Media {
            bindings = <
        &trans    &trans    &trans     &trans      &trans    &trans        &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &trans        &trans
        &kp LGUI  &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHIFT  &trans    &kp C_REWIND  &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOL_UP          &kp C_FF      &ext_power EP_TOG
&trans  &trans    &trans    &trans     &trans      &trans    &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1          &bt BT_SEL 2          &bt BT_SEL 3  &out OUT_TOG       &trans
                            &trans     &trans      &trans    &kp C_STOP    &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE      &kp C_MUTE
            >;

            label = "Media";
        };

        Functions {
            display-name = "Functions";
            bindings = <
        &kp F1  &kp F4  &kp F7  &kp F10  &kp F13    &trans  &trans      &trans     &trans        &trans
        &kp F2  &kp F5  &kp F8  &kp F11  &kp F14    &trans  &kp LSHIFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LGUI
&trans  &kp F3  &kp F6  &kp F9  &kp F12  &kp F15    &trans  &trans      &trans     &trans        &trans    &trans
                        &trans  &trans   &trans     &trans  &trans      &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
